# Home Assistant (the user of the MQTT integration)
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #

# Qingping CGDN1 monitors: publish own data, receive commands, nothing else
user qingping
topic write qingping/+/up
topic read  qingping/+/down

# Other clients (Zigbee2MQTT, ESPHome, ...): give them their own topics,
# but NO write access to qingping/# and preferably no read access either
# (type-13 messages contain SSID and BSSID).
